1
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:42,360
Random overlaps exist in the space-time of the universe.

2
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:46,289
Repeating the act of space-time overlapping can trigger time travel.

3
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:50,080
It's like extending infinite branches from a single point,

4
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:51,360
infinite possibilities,

5
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:54,360
entering and creating a brand new parallel universe.

6
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,840
Time travel is such an awesome ability.

7
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:57,920
Why call it a curse?

8
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,560
Because once you time travel

9
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,720
and gain multiplied time,

10
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,920
you will suffer a backlash from time.

11
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,040
You might fall into a time loop.

12
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,880
No end to life or death.

13
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,120
Nowhere to escape.

14
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:11,380
It can't be that scary, right?

15
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:12,760
That nursery rhyme,

16
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,600
how does it go again?

17
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,460
You must never sing the last line.

18
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:16,280
Otherwise...

19
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:25,760
A shadow comes for revenge.

20
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,020
I can't just die like this.

21
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,280
I have to go back.

22
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,130
I need to find out who the killer is.

23
00:02:57,720 --> 00:03:00,000
Mr. Dai, who is playing the piano?

24
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,640
An old friend. Go inside

25
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,640
and look at my collection.

26
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,680
Come.

27
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:09,320
I'm back.

28
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,940
The knife is under the pillow.

29
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,620
Is it the knife that killed me?

30
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:29,140
Which one of them left it just now?

31
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,810
Is it a reminder or a threat?

32
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,810
There is no knife under the pillow.

33
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,120
There are five people in the villa in total.

34
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,680
Who wrote the note?

35
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,120
Who wants to kill me?

36
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,660
Why are you still here?

37
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,280
Everyone is waiting for you.

38
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,800
Don't you want to see An'an,

39
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,220
or can't you let her go?

40
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,440
It's all in the past.

41
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,170
Now I have to do right by Sophie.

42
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:18,240
Did you mention my matter to Lao Dai?

43
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,720
I understand.

44
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,760
After all, the award ceremony is tomorrow.

45
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,200
It is indeed a bit tricky,

46
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,280
but we had a deal.

47
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,040
Xiaotao,

48
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:32,440
what I'm dealing with now is even trickier.

49
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,420
Someone wants to kill you.

50
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,040
Yes.

51
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,040
Old Dai.

52
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,240
Mr. Dai.

53
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:47,560
Mr. Dai.

54
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:50,560
Why did he suddenly invite us to this isolated island villa?

55
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,360
An'an.

56
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,720
She disappeared for three years.

57
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,200
Why did she suddenly appear here?

58
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:54,960
And Sophie.

59
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:57,560
She never told me about her relationship with An'an.

60
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,890
An'an couldn't possibly want to harm you.

61
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,440
If you really don't want to tell Old Dai,

62
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,320
you can tell me.

63
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,480
Don't be like Mala back then.

64
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,240
Mala.

65
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:12,280
Only we know Mala's secret.

66
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,840
Back then, it was because

67
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,400
someone...

68
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:40,320
Could it be a side effect of your headache medicine?

69
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:43,380
An improper dosage might have affected your judgment.

70
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,720
No.

71
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,940
It's not the medicine.

72
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:52,920
Why?

73
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,600
Why did this have to happen to me?

74
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,080
I can't die here.

75
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,520
It's been so many years.

76
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,600
I've worked hard for so many years.

77
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,280
I finally made it this far.

78
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,920
I'm only one step away from the Xinghe Award.

79
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,320
It's us.

80
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:12,160
We are only one step away from success.

81
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:14,880
Xiaotao.

82
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,720
I'll take you to see it.

83
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,980
There's no such thing as time travel.

84
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,760
Brother, stop taking that medicine.

85
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,080
Pull yourself together.

86
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:58,120
Remember to tell Mr. Dai about that.

87
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,600
Give me a hand.

88
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:11,840
The focus now is to get 'The Death of Marat'.

89
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:12,680
Zhiwei,

90
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,740
your favorite cherry flavor.

91
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,640
Then you can talk to me about the profit sharing.

92
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:20,760
Mr. Dai, regarding the copyright,

93
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:23,120
Zhiwei has some new updates to tell you.

94
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,640
What other new updates are there?

95
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:27,040
Brother, say something.

96
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,520
You don't know the happiness now.

97
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:36,800
Does Zhiwei like chocolate flavor?

98
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,680
I think cherry is your favorite flavor.

99
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:45,320
Zhiwei, do you like chocolate flavor now?

100
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,770
What do you say, Zhiwei?

101
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,480
You can only choose one.

102
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,650
I'd like to ask everyone first.

103
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:54,320
Who wrote this?

104
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,780
Whose gimmick is this?

105
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,400
What the hell is this?

106
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,320
The knife is under the pillow.

107
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,330
What does this mean?

108
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,240
Why are you looking at me?

109
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,600
It has nothing to do with me.

110
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:11,040
We are here to talk business.

111
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,770
Who would do this for no reason?

112
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,640
I didn't write it.

113
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:16,600
But this handwriting

114
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,360
looks a bit familiar.

115
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:25,040
This looks like

116
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,960
your handwriting.

117
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,440
Sister An'an really knows you well.

118
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,900
She recognized the handwriting at a glance.

119
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,240
Zhiwei.

120
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:37,049
Does this sentence have any deep meaning?

121
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,919
Could it be a setup

122
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,720
to test if you've forgotten him?

123
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:45,040
Impossible. I never wrote this.

124
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:49,460
Someone must be copying my handwriting.

125
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,690
Young people nowadays.

126
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,480
They haven't won the prize or got the money,

127
00:08:54,960 --> 00:08:57,020
but their brains are already broken.

128
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:05,600
I'm not crazy.

129
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:08,240
This note is proof.

130
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,690
I didn't write these words at all. Really.

131
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:15,000
Why did Lao Dai mention Mala just now?

132
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,680
What if all this has something to do with Mala?

133
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,960
Those who were involved with Mala back then

134
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,200
either went crazy or went to prison.

135
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:19,880
You know that.

136
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,960
No one knows what exactly happened back then.

137
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:24,280
Let's not make assumptions or overthink.

138
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,640
I'm not making assumptions.

139
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,080
Do you know what déjà vu is?

140
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,610
I've seen this cake before.

141
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:32,640
Xiaotao, if I do nothing,

142
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,720
Twelve o'clock... I will die here at twelve o'clock.

143
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,960
Twelve o'clock... I will die here at twelve o'clock.

144
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:38,920
Bro, stop taking that medicine.

145
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,240
Your illness isn't cured yet,

146
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,920
and you haven't won the Xinghe Award.

147
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,320
Don't let the side effects ruin you first.

148
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,600
I'm not sick.

149
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:50,040
Don't tell anyone about my medication.

150
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,360
Calm down.

151
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:57,120
I want you to live more than anyone else.

152
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:12,100
Zhiwei is acting very strange today.

153
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:14,960
He was fine before he saw you.

154
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,760
You mean I only bring him pain?

155
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,640
If you love, love wholeheartedly.

156
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:26,440
If not, cut ties completely.

157
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,200
Either way,

158
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,970
there has to be a result, right?

159
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:32,300
What's the point of being ambiguous?

160
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,080
Then what about you and Mala?

161
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:39,840
Are you that obsessed with being a substitute?

162
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:46,440
Whatever you know,

163
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,120
it has nothing to do with you.

164
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,240
Xiaofei, Xiaofei.

165
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,240
Xiaofei.

166
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,000
Xiaofei.

167
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:24,040
Xiaofei, Xiaofei.

168
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,080
What's wrong?

169
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,480
My Xiaofei.

170
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:33,920
Xiaofei.

171
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,920
In places I don't know about,

172
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:42,040
the murder has already begun.

173
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:44,440
Dead things and financial loss are omens of great misfortune.

174
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:46,700
My room has always been perfectly clean.

175
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,680
Did one of you come in

176
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,680
carrying something unclean?

177
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,480
I'll handle it.

178
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:56,760
I'll do it.

179
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:02,040
It was poisoned.

180
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,200
How is that possible?

181
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,850
Why would anyone kill a dog?

182
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,810
The cake was meant for a person.

183
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,800
Maybe the killer's original target

184
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,600
wasn't Xiaofei.

185
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:15,800
Everyone present

186
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:18,760
could be in danger.

187
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:20,800
Similarly,

188
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,360
everyone

189
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:25,320
could be the killer.
